WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.308
Lab 2 moves to a test tenant
with fictional people,

2
00:00:03.308 --> 00:00:05.612
never production, and it only reads.

3
00:00:05.612 --> 00:00:10.454
You register the app in the tenant's own
cloud with a certificate, grant exactly

4
00:00:10.454 --> 00:00:14.850
the five permissions plus Reader on a
test subscription, sign in, and run.

5
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:18.181
Then comes the useful part:
download the admin center's

6
00:00:18.181 --> 00:00:21.363
list of assignments, as
Learn describes, and compare.

7
00:00:21.363 --> 00:00:24.049
Every active row should
be in the inventory,

8
00:00:24.049 --> 00:00:28.675
and the inventory should also hold the
eligible rows the download can't see.

9
00:00:28.675 --> 00:00:32.740
Check the two assumptions the fixture
made, then back everything out.
